WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.490
Oh no!

2
00:00:01.490 --> 00:00:06.274
Eddie needs a toy from inside Sammy, but Sammy is locked!

3
00:00:06.274 --> 00:00:10.180
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:12.800
This is Episode 39.

5
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.589
Maya could give Eddie a name tag.

6
00:00:15.589 --> 00:00:18.822
Then Eddie could open Sammy any time.

7
00:00:18.822 --> 00:00:20.553
Even at night.

8
00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:23.125
Even when nobody is looking.

9
00:00:23.125 --> 00:00:25.168
That is too much.

10
00:00:25.168 --> 00:00:28.401
So Maya hands him a badge instead.

11
00:00:28.401 --> 00:00:30.421
Eddie clips it on.

12
00:00:30.421 --> 00:00:31.695
Click!

13
00:00:31.695 --> 00:00:33.654
Sammy opens.

14
00:00:33.654 --> 00:00:35.889
Eddie takes one toy.

15
00:00:35.889 --> 00:00:38.858
Then he hands the badge right back.

16
00:00:38.858 --> 00:00:40.132
Click!

17
00:00:40.132 --> 00:00:42.260
Sammy locks again.

18
00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:44.339
Eddie keeps nothing.

19
00:00:44.339 --> 00:00:46.743
Borrow it for one job.

20
00:00:46.743 --> 00:00:48.798
Give it straight back.

21
00:00:48.798 --> 00:00:51.178
That is the borrowed badge.

22
00:00:51.178 --> 00:00:53.822
Now you know IAM roles!

23
00:00:53.822 --> 00:00:58.065
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!
